<h2>The bottom line</h2>

<p>Mailchimp is a strong email marketing tool. It always has been. But for most small businesses, email marketing is just one piece of the puzzle. You need CRM, automation, booking, funnels, SMS, and review management working together. Mailchimp can handle one of those. DUSA handles all of them.</p>

<p>If email is all you need, Mailchimp is fine. If you need a growth platform that connects every part of your customer journey, DUSA is the more complete solution.</p>

